  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v10.0.5 (SpawnDev fork): Production-TURN extensions for browser-interop WebRTC deployments. (1) TurnServerConfig.ResolveHmacKey - per-request HMAC-SHA1 key resolver for ephemeral / REST-API TURN credentials (RFC 8489 §9.2 pattern, Twilio/Cloudflare/coturn --use-auth-secret). (2) TurnServerConfig.RelayPortRangeStart/End - bounded relay-socket port range for NAT port-forwarding (matches coturn --min-port/--max-port). (3) SctpAssociation.MaxBurst + BurstPeriodMilliseconds - per-association SCTP burst tunables (RFC 4960 §7.2.2) for throughput-sensitive data-channel deployments. (4) SctpDataSender producer-consumer lost-wakeup race fix (60x speedup on localhost loopback / fast-SACK paths). All backward-compatible defaults. Burned in at hub.spawndev.com. Full changelog: see CHANGELOG.md in the repo.",
